category: Libs
build-depends: cygport check dbus gobject-introspection gtk-doc libgirepository1.0-devel libglib2.0-devel libsqlite3-devel libxml2-devel python3-devel python312-gi vala
sdesc: "Single signon authentication library for GLib applications"
ldesc: "This project is a library for managing single signon credentials which can be
used from GLib applications. It is effectively a GLib binding for the D-Bus
API provided by signond. It is part of the accounts-sso project."
skip:

homepage: https://gitlab.com/accounts-sso/libaccounts-glib
